ed":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add an AC (and unit test) for (a) summarize() when an annotation read fails/returns nothing, and (b) the step's behavior when the jobs-listing call fails or returns empty JOBS_JSON.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e","T6","T7","T9"],"criteria":["E6","T5b"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.075,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'best-effort, a failed read degrades wording but must not fail the step' — no AC covers this branch","AC2 covers 'cancelled-without-annotation' (a job with no annotation) which is distinct from a failed annotation READ","No statement of what JOBS_JSON contains or how summarize() behaves if the jobs-listing call itself fails"],"finding":"The plan specifies the annotation read as best-effort ('a failed read degrades wording but must not fail the step') but no acceptance criterion exercises the degraded-wording path, and the summarize step's primary input (the jobs listing gh api call) has no stated behavior if IT fails.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fd0d91acfbe42f6fd","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 2 / ACs","norm_id":"n56e65354deec2e26","priority":0.875,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":["The gh api jobs call fails or returns empty during a real -1 run; summarize() behavior is unspecified and untested — it may emit an empty or misleading comment."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"State that summarize() with empty/missing JOBS_JSON returns \"\" (no comment) and that a failed annotation read yields the plain 'cancelled' wording; cover both with tests.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.875,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation